Dear Volunteer,

Thank you very much for your interest in volunteering for the upcoming
Graduation
& Recognition Ceremonies of PUP Sto. Tomas Campus Batch 2025.

After careful screening of applications, we would like to inform you that
you are currently on our waitlist. This means that while we are unable to
assign you a volunteer slot at the moment, we may reach out to you once a
spot becomes available or if additional support is needed.

Your willingness to help is sincerely appreciated, and we hope to be able
to collaborate with you in future activities and events.

Should any changes arise regarding your status, we will notify you as soon
as possible. For inquiries, you may reach us through this email.


With gratitude,

*Graduation Steering Committee*

PUP Sto. Tomas Campus

--000000000000c137a3063a94872f
